# Release lock

Staging → prod is forbidden unless Chase explicitly allows that release.
"Do it on prod" / "hide it on prod" is not permission to tag. Only a
dedicated release subagent may tag, approve Production, or dispatch the prod
release, and it does only the release. Product workers stop at `origin/main`
and a staging candidate. SoT: `~/.cstack/src/docs/RELEASE-LOCK.md`.
